                                <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                              </Style>
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>liable to pay if the supply is higher than PO quantity. We’ll not take responsibility for any excess quantity supplied. Vendor will arrange the returns of excesses by his own.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
